Package: macosdeps
Type: Package
Title: Fixture Package for macOS System Dependency Checks
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Posit Software, PBC", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "info@posit.co")
Description: Test fixture used by the shiny-workflows integration workflow.
    It declares the packages that used to require Homebrew system libraries
    on macOS, so that CI can prove they install as binaries now that
    'setup-r-package' no longer runs 'brew install'. Not intended for
    distribution.
License: CC0
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    Cairo,
    terra,
    textshaping,
    units
